{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港迪士尼明日起陸續展開聖誕節慶活動。</p><p></p><p>其中「美國小鎮大街」的聖誕樹，由本周四起每天傍晚會有亮燈儀式，配合無人機表演，展示迪士尼多款卡通人物，米奇等經典角色亦換上聖誕裝扮，與入場人士見面。</p><p></p><p>園內多處均亦添置聖誕裝飾，而「魔雪奇緣世界」園區新設了冬日市集，有應節食品及攤位遊戲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.516917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:31:53.243261+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:40.623480+00:00","content_hash":"4a6ce476ad71c3f76d91055e7201fcb8d61daf2548f54db0b00e6a8127be49df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.516917+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}